{
	"name": "Breaching Blast",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/weapons/guns/gun-blunderbuss-gold.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You’ve learned that sometimes the best way to attack a target behind cover is to destroy the cover. When you miss a target that is behind cover, you may use your reaction to deal an amount of slashing damage equal to your Dexterity modifier to the target. Doing so reduces the quality of their cover by one step. If your target is behind full cover, you must still be able to target the space they are in for this maneuver to have any effect. This maneuver has no effect if the cover is more than 6 inches thick.</p>",
